/S /H3
/T (Start instalation from the ridge. Lay the first row of full panels and fasten them along the rear flange. The panels of the next row should be slipped under the panels of the upper row. The overlapping panel must cover the overlap channel. )
/E (Start instalation from the ridge. Lay the first row of full panels and fasten them along the rear flange. The panels of the next row should be slipped under the panels of the upper row. The overlapping panel must cover the overlap channel. )
