/E (To create a closed valley, find and establish the center of the valley by either marking a line or following existing center rib. After valley flashing has been fit and secured into the valley area, start on one side of the valley by measuring, cutting, bending and installing panels as accurately as possible to create a clean straight line. Next, measure, cut and bend panels to fill in the other side of the valley. Make sure these panels meet the pannels from the opposing side of the valley.)
